>**Raises nation's Prosperity, Resources and Supplies at the cost of Supplies.**
=2 Walkthrough
+ You must participate in a Campaign battle in one of your nation's territories.
+ After the battle, your performance will be evaluated automatically.
+ Report back to {n:Rasdinice} to receive your reward.

=2 Notes
* You still get the EXP/limit Points and Allied Notes from the campaign battle as well as the reward from the Campaign Op.
* This is a **defensive** operation. Attacking an enemy stronghold in a campaign battle does not complete it, you must defend one controlled by your nation.
* It appears you don't actually need to participate in the battle at all, just get the tags and turn them back in. __(verification needed)__
* If you are knocked out at end of battle you will not be rewarded with the additional EXP/limit points from this quest. __(verification needed)__(Allied Notes are still obtainable.)
* A notice saying you have completed the mission and earned Experience Points will appear in the message window upon satisfactory completion of the objectives. You must return to {n:Rasdinice}, however, in order to receive the {p:Allied Notes} portion of your reward.
* Dissconnected in the middle of campaign battle, came back after at was over and still recieved credit for this op.

=2 Objective
\**Unit Requirement:** 1 member
